From 52954127772b17914071ce5ac51edbae5a32827b Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Synthetic Benchmark Review <review@example.invalid>
Date: Sat, 17 Oct 2026 14:45:05 +0800
Subject: [PATCH 2/7] Add one-pass GOO-seeded interval dynamic programming

Refine the best of the two completed GOO seed orders with interval
dynamic programming using normal join legality and path generation.
Retain the seed's complete and partial paths and project candidates
onto one final relation target before selecting the cheapest path.

Finalize each interval level and restore temporary planner state.
Reject an incomplete refinement instead of falling back to GOO or DP.
